### 1. ALUR PEMBELI (PUBLIC)

### A. Homepage: Ambil Daftar Game & Metadata Form
GET {{host}}/games/brands
Accept: application/json

---

### A1. Homepage: Batch pertama section kategori (12 game)
GET {{host}}/games/brands?category=mobile&offset=0&limit=12
Accept: application/json

---

### A1b. Homepage: Batch "Tampilkan lebih banyak" (24 game berikutnya)
GET {{host}}/games/brands?category=mobile&offset=12&limit=24
Accept: application/json

---

### A1c. Homepage: Section "Lainnya" (brand yang belum dikategorikan admin)
GET {{host}}/games/brands?category=lainnya&offset=0&limit=6
Accept: application/json

---

### A2. Homepage: Ambil Daftar Kategori Storefront
GET {{host}}/games/categories
Accept: application/json

---

### B. Halaman Detail: Ambil Daftar Diamond
GET {{host}}/games/mobile-legends
Accept: application/json

---

### C. Checkout: Buat Pesanan Baru (Test Dynamic ID)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 23,
  "targetId": "12345678",
  "zoneId": "1234"
}

### 2. ALUR ADMIN (BUTUH TOKEN)

### A. Login Admin (Dapatkan Token JWT)
POST {{host}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### B. Cek Riwayat Pesanan (Harus pakai Token)
GET {{host}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

---

### C. Cek Saldo Digiflazz (live dari supplier)
GET {{host}}/admin/dashboard/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
